{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"14976","name":"Exe Gran Hotel Almenar","description":"This upmarket hotel is located opposite Las Matas train station, close to the Parque Empresarial de Las Rozas business park, Heron City leisure center, and Las Rozas Village and Factory shopping center. Public transport is within walking distance. The fully air-conditioned hotel offers a cafe bar, a restaurant, and three conference rooms with a capacity of up to 150 people. Free parking is available in the hotel's garage. The spacious and comfortably appointed soundproofed rooms each feature an en suite bathroom, a lounge area, an office space, and a balcony. All rooms are well-equipped. The hotel also provides specially designed rooms for guests with disabilities. The nearest golf course is 5 km away, and a ski resort with lifts and slopes is approximately 30 km from the hotel. Guests can enjoy a breakfast buffet each morning.","address":"Jaraiz, 1","city":"LAS ROZAS DE MADRID","countryCode":"ES","postalCode":"28290","lat":40.554559,"lng":-3.900211,"stars":4,"chain":"EUROS","giataCode":"138930","phone":"+34916308128","email":"info@granhotelalmenar.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014976/014976a_hb_a_018.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014976/014976a_hb_a_020.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014976/014976a_hb_a_056.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014976/014976a_hb_a_031.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014976/014976a_hb_a_035.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014976/014976a_hb_a_039.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014976/014976a_hb_a_043.jpg","category":"exterior","order":6},{"url":"https://ph